Description

Tom is an agricultural robot developed by Small Robot Company to scan crops and provide detailed plant-level data.  ￼

Methods Used
	•	Artificial intelligence
	•	High-resolution cameras
	•	Image recognition
	•	Data mapping

Design Approach

Tom is designed as a lightweight ground robot with advanced imaging systems to monitor crops at the individual plant level.  ￼

Implementation Approach

The robot scans fields, detects weeds and crop health conditions, and generates detailed maps to guide farming decisions.  ￼



