5. FarmBot

🔗 https://farmbot.com.au/

Description

FarmBot is an open-source automated farming system that performs planting, watering, and monitoring of crops.  ￼

Methods Used
	•	Computer-controlled farming system
	•	Sensors
	•	Automation software
	•	Open-source platform

Design Approach

FarmBot uses a fixed gantry system instead of a moving rover. It operates within a defined area using precise coordinate control.  ￼

Implementation Approach

The system automatically performs farming tasks such as planting seeds, watering crops, and monitoring soil conditions using programmed instructions.  ￼
